<div class="ed-reading guide-reading text-lg">
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">A controlled test can show whether one account can send and receive at that moment. It cannot prove delivery to every recipient or rule out later filtering. Use only an account you control or a trusted consenting contact. Do not include passwords, codes, private documents or attachments.</p>
<section class="ed-start" id="start" aria-labelledby="start-heading"><p class="ed-label">Start here</p><h2 id="start-heading">Make the test small and observable</h2><p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Record the time and result at each step. A successful test is useful evidence, not a universal delivery guarantee.</p><div class="ed-choices">
